[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Position the vehicle on the ramp.</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584157\">1008A46</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584193\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>1. Screw two bolts in the appropriate seats to stop the rotation\nof the pressure pump pulley.</p><p>2. Undo the pressure pump drive pulley nut.</p><p>Remove the two bolts used to stop the rotation\nof the pressure pump pulley.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021749.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>1. Remove the pressure pump pulley (1a) using the tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Extractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.954.001</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021750.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Place the pressure pump drive pulley back\nin its housing and secure with the nut but do not tighten.</p><p>Screw two bolts in the appropriate seats\nto stop the rotation of the pressure pump pulley.</p><p>1. Tighten the nut (1a) securing the  pressure pump drive pulley\nusing tool (1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>PRESSURE PUMP CONTROL PULLEY</p></td><td><p>M14</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Pressure pump side) 4.5 ÷ 5.5</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Spanner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.857.167.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Remove the two bolts used to stop the rotation\nof the pressure pump pulley.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021751.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584193\">1032B10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584157\">1008A46</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a>\n                                           .</p><p>Remove the car from the ramp.</p>"]]